      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft woven-look shirt fabric with blue vertical stripes, based on the vendor imagery and the attached size-chart source.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A relaxed matching shirt for moms, dads, girls, and boys that feels easy for everyday photos and casual outings.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Blue Stripe keeps the outfit simple and versatile, with a classic collared shirt shape, vertical stripes, and visible pocket detail.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Long sleeves, button front, relaxed fit, collared neckline, chest pockets, and an easy overshirt silhouette. White tees, pants, shoes, and hats shown in photos are styling only.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold, turn inside out, line dry or tumble low, and avoid bleach. This is conservative care guidance because the blocked vendor page did not expose wash instructions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 1-2Y through Child 9-10Y and Adult S through Adult 3XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n      <th>Sleeve (cm)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or - (cm)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>9-11.5</td>\n<td>75-85</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>36</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>12-14.5</td>\n<td>86-95</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>31</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>39</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>15-17.5</td>\n<td>96-105</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>34</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>18-20</td>\n<td>106-115</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>37</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>45</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>20.5-22.5</td>\n<td>116-125</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>48</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>23-25</td>\n<td>126-135</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>43</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>51</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>25.5-30</td>\n<td>136-145</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>54</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>30.5-40</td>\n<td>145-155</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>98</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>57</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>47.5-57.5</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>98</td>\n<td>53</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>98</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>63</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>58-62.5</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>102</td>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>102</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>65</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>63-69.5</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>106</td>\n<td>55</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>106</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>67</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70-77.5</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>98</td>\n<td>69</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 2XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>78-85</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>114</td>\n<td>58</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>114</td>\n<td>102</td>\n<td>71</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 3XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>85.5-95</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>118</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>118</td>\n<td>106</td>\n<td>73</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Blue Stripe is a laid-back family matching top with enough structure to look polished in photos and enough ease for real family days. The shirt works as a light overshirt over a tee, with a button front, relaxed body, and soft blue-stripe color that coordinates across kids and adults without feeling overly formal.</p>\n\n<p>The attached vendor chart publishes one child ladder and one adult ladder rather than separate girl, boy, mom, and dad tables, so this draft keeps the variant structure honest with Child and Adult size labels instead of inventing unsupported role-specific rows. Chest is doubled from the source half-chest column; hip and waist are derived because the source omits them; and the try-on report supports the relaxed fit language across both kids and adults.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>One coordinated shirt:</strong> Same blue-stripe button-up look for children and adults.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready stripe:</strong> Soft blue color, vertical striping, chest pockets, and a casual overshirt shape.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Relaxed family fit:</strong> Vendor try-on notes show loose fits for the boy, mom, and dad testers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy styling:</strong> Layer over white tees with casual pants for a clean family look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed variants:</strong> Every size option is backed by the attached vendor size chart.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the child and adult sizes you need to build an easy matching blue striped look for family photos, travel days, and everyday outings.</p>",
